<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Details of Czech Sporitelna H1 results.</title>
<headline>Details of Czech Sporitelna H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Detailed preliminary results for savings bank Ceska Sporitelna a.s. for six-month period ending June 30, 1997, according to Czech accounting standards:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> balance sheet total		 363,480.816     vs 349,654.934</p>
<p> basic capital			   7,600.000     vs   7,600.000</p>
<p> reserves				  2,458.371     vs   2,881.827</p>
<p> capital funds			   4,368.700     vs   4,341.186</p>
<p> reserve funds and other funds     6,795.407     vs   5,359.482</p>
<p>from profits</p>
<p>PROFIT AND LOSS STATEMENT</p>
<p> received interest		    17,094.315     vs  15,617.019</p>
<p> paid-out interest		    -9,868.313     vs  -8,922.357</p>
<p>earnings from</p>
<p>  floating rate securities		 1.310     vs	 1.017</p>
<p> earnings from property		  148.538     vs	36.164</p>
<p> earnings from fees/provisions     1,569.893     vs     854.397</p>
<p> paid-out fees/provisions	     -240.399     vs    -133.872</p>
<p> result from financial operations -1,077.223     vs     334.076</p>
<p> earnings from financial leasing	     0     vs	     0</p>
<p> other earnings			    464.031     vs     139.007</p>
<p> general operating costs	    -3,911.637     vs  -3,840.616</p>
<p>depreciation and creation of</p>
<p> provisions/reserves for property -1,096.035     vs  -  844.196</p>
<p> costs of financial leasing		    0     vs	     0</p>
<p> other operating costs		-1,838.769     vs  -2,719.724</p>
<p>creation of reserves and</p>
<p> provisions against credit	  -1,720.067     vs  -1,648.302</p>
<p>used reserves and provisions</p>
<p>	    against credit	     1,373.670     vs   2,474.763</p>
<p>creation of other reserves</p>
<p>    and provisions			 -72.841     vs     -70.983</p>
<p>use of other reserves</p>
<p> and provisions				3.977     vs	 0.005</p>
<p> extraordinary earnings		   22.946     vs	52.883</p>
<p> extraordinary costs		     -50.351     vs     -38.079</p>
<p> after-tax profit			  803.045     vs   1,291.202</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
